  "body": "A significant price adjustment has put this substantial Glendowie residence firmly in the sights of value-conscious buyers. With expansive Hauraki Gulf views, generous family accommodation and a premium coastal position, the amount of property on offer deserves serious consideration. The owners have responded to the market, and their instructions are clear. They want this sold.\r\n\r\n* Four generous bedrooms plus a substantial study provide excellent accommodation for families of all ages.\r\n\r\n* Two separate living areas, including a lower-level kitchenette, offer flexibility for teenagers, guests or extended family.\r\n\r\n* Sweeping views across Tahuna Torea and the Hauraki Gulf from the main living spaces and elevated balcony.\r\n\r\n* Generous outdoor space with existing plans for a swimming pool.\r\n\r\n* Extensive off-street parking accommodates boats, recreational equipment and additional vehicles.\r\n\r\n* Zoned for Glendowie Primary and Glendowie College, with Sacred Heart College an easy walk away.\r\n\r\n* A well-established coastal neighbourhood with beaches, reserves and local amenities close by.\r\n\r\nThe new asking price warrants a fresh look, particularly for buyers who may have previously considered this property beyond their budget. The owners are realistic, motivated and are engaging with the market.\r\n\r\nYour earliest inspection is recommended. All genuine offers are encouraged.",
